00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:53.340
And, you know, I'm on a show with these incredible actors and it really, I was thinking, I need
提升一下自己。

391
00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.880
to like step it up.
斯蒂芬妮说，我可以让你参加我的训练营，但你必须听从我的一切安排。

