Memorizing bootcamp?
好的。

397
00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:09.480
She was saying essentially, I'll teach you my process, but you have to do everything I
所以我照做了。

398
00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:09.920
tell you.
好的。

399
00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:10.300
Okay.
是的。

400
00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.100
And so I did that.
所以我照做了。

401
00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.340
I was in Toronto working.
当时我在多伦多工作。

402
00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.200
I saw a new side of my wife I hadn't seen.
我看到了妻子我不曾见过的一面。

403
00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:19.660
We've been together 12 years and she was no joke.
我们在一起12年了，她可不是闹着玩的。

404
00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:24.820
She was so intense and serious about doing this, making it work.
她对待这件事非常专注和认真，一心想把它做好。

405
00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:29.080
And I have to say her process has changed my life.
我不得不说，她的方法改变了我的生活。

406
00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:33.260
I mean, I had done all the typical things of running the lines over and over.
我是说，我以前做过所有常规的事情，比如一遍又一遍地背台词。

