00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:34.900
I wrote them out a million times.
我把它们写下来写了无数遍。

408
00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:40.820
I did it with other people or I would record myself saying the other side of the lines.
我会找别人对戏，或者录下自己说对方台词的声音。

409
00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:46.400
And I was struggling and her process has made everything so much easier for me.
我以前一直很吃力，但她的方法让一切对我来说都变得容易多了。

410
00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:50.260
And I'm excited to do not just Star Trek.
我不仅对《星际迷航》感到兴奋。

411
00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:53.380
And this came at the end of season one of this new show.
这件事发生在这部新剧第一季结束的时候。

