I'm struggling through the whole, and I'm like making jokes.
我全程都很吃力，只能在那儿开玩笑。

424
00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:48.500
And I thought for sure people were going to be like, you got to, but they were all so amused
我本以为大家肯定会觉得我该认真点，但他们都被逗乐了，

425
00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:55.800
and they were like, we're bringing you on every panel because I just, I stopped after
他们说，以后每个座谈会都要带上我，因为我从那次之后，

426
00:18:55.800 --> 00:19:03.120
that first time trying to pretend like I was, you know, really, I can't compete with those
就不再假装自己很专业了，你知道，我确实没法和那些，

427
00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.060
actors that are out there.
顶尖的演员竞争。

