maybe 50,000 people watched IFC, you know?
大概只有五万人看过IFC，你懂的吧？

1281
00:58:13.690 --> 00:58:18.470
So anyway, I was very excited to do The Office.
总之，我当时非常兴奋能参演《办公室》。

1282
00:58:18.470 --> 00:58:18.590
I was
我

1283
