very flattered.
受宠若惊。

1284
00:58:19.330 --> 00:58:23.970
I was very honored, but I just did not do anything I was proud of.
我感到非常荣幸，但我确实没做出什么让我引以为傲的表现。

1285
00:58:24.470 --> 00:58:26.910
What have I enjoyed?
我享受过什么？

1286
00:58:28.550 --> 00:58:31.590
Oh, that is really a hard question.
噢，这真是个难题。

1287
00:58:31.950 --> 00:58:32.250
It is.
确实是。

1288
00:58:32.370 --> 00:58:32.470
It is.
确实是。

1289
00:58:32.690 --> 00:58:34.490
It's really hard because it's like mentioning
这真的很难，就像提到

1290
00:58:34.490 --> 00:58:35.490
instant family.
《速成家庭》一样。

1291
00:58:35.770 --> 00:58:42.310
I was a social worker with Octavia Spencer, and we just had the greatest time.
我和奥克塔维亚·斯宾瑟一起演社工，我们合作得非常愉快。

1292
00:58:42.490 --> 00:58:42.710
Rose
萝丝·

1293
